  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Banja Luka Water Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IPA 2020 will co-finance implementation of Banja Luka Water Project on expansion and rehabilitation of water supply and sewage network in Banja Luka, with the amount of Euro 4.0 million grant funds. The Project will be financed through EBRD loan of 10 million EUR aiming to improve water services for 186.000 inhabitants. (EBRD loans: Phase 1 - EUR 4.0 million; Phase 2 -  EUR 6.0 million).</narrative>
  </description>
